{"name":"Pine Scented Lagoon","hex":"#066f6c","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"pine","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Any coniferous tree of the genus Pinus.","Any tree (usually coniferous) which resembles a member of this genus in some respect."]},{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A painful longing."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/pine"},{"term":"scented","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Having a pleasant aroma.","Having a smell of any kind."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["simple past and past participle of scent"]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/scented"},{"term":"lagoon","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A shallow body of water separated from deeper sea by a bar."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/lagoon"}],"entries":[{"title":"Pine","blocks":[{"text":"Pines ) are a genus of conifers in the family Pinaceae. Pinus is the sole genus in the subfamily Pinoideae. The species are trees or shrubs with their leaves in bunches, usually of 2 to 5 needles. The seeds are carried on woody cones, with two seeds to each cone scale."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3f/Pinus_jeffreyi_at_Lassen_Volcanic_National_Park.jpg/330px-Pinus_jeffreyi_at_Lassen_Volcanic_National_Park.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pine","wikidata":"Q12024"},{"title":"Lagoon","blocks":[{"text":"A lagoon is a shallow body of water separated from a larger body of water by a narrow landform, such as a reef, a barrier island or islands, a barrier peninsula, or an isthmus. Lagoons are commonly divided into coastal lagoons and atoll lagoons. They have also been identified as occurring on mixed-sand and gravel coastlines. There is an overlap between bodies of water classified as coastal lagoons and bodies of water classified as estuaries. Lagoons are common coastal features around many parts of the world."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/33/BalosLagoonCreta.jpg/330px-BalosLagoonCreta.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lagoon","wikidata":"Q187223"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/40/Pinus_range.png/500px-Pinus_range.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/40/Pinus_range.png/1280px-Pinus_range.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/40/Pinus_range.png/500px-Pinus_range.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3APinus_range.png"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/80/Pinus_lambertiana_ProspectOR.jpg/250px-Pinus_lambertiana_ProspectOR.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/80/Pinus_lambertiana_ProspectOR.jpg/330px-Pinus_lambertiana_ProspectOR.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/80/Pinus_lambertiana_ProspectOR.jpg/250px-Pinus_lambertiana_ProspectOR.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3APinus_lambertiana_ProspectOR.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1d/Pinus_culminicola.jpg/250px-Pinus_culminicola.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1d/Pinus_culminicola.jpg/500px-Pinus_culminicola.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wik